<title>POLAND: RAFAKO AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO AUG NET JUMPS TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.88 vs   1.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.88 vs   2.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.96 vs   3.87</p>
<p> Sales		   28.55 vs  33.10</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.63 vs  12.56</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.63 vs  20.71</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.12 vs  25.03</p>
<p> Sales		  255.44 vs 233.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish industrial boilermaker is</p>
<p>Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
